      "text": "Board members will work recruiting shifts at the county fair.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "3Jc9Mp68Wcs",
        "ts": "0:08:14",
        "endTs": "0:09:36",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:48.406Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-17",
      "text": "The County published the list of charter amendments qualified for the general election ballot, including the exact ballot text for the question on repealing the Independent Nomination Board.",
      "basis": "reported",
      "source": {
        "type": "county-release",
        "url": "https://mauicountyvotes.gov/news-releases",
        "publisher": "County of Maui",
        "quote": "Resolution 26-93, CD1, FD1: “Shall the Charter be amended, effective immediately, to repeal the parts of the 2022 Charter amendment that created the Independent Nomination Board and related procedures for nominations for various County officers?”",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-25T01:47:00.273Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-09",
      "text": "Staff agreed to bring a plan and timeline for the Temporary Investigative Group (TIG) to the next meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "x2IjROxHuYY",
