        "endTs": "1:06:47",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:00.900Z"
      },
      "body": "Independent Nomination Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-09",
      "text": "Motion to form one Temporary Investigative Group (TIG) for mass nominations: The board approved a new motion to form one TIG to interview, score and recommend applicants.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "x2IjROxHuYY",
        "ts": "0:40:58",
        "endTs": "0:42:27",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:00.900Z"
      },
      "body": "Independent Nomination Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-09",
      "text": "The board voted, with five ayes, to form two TIGs, small groups of members, to interview, score and recommend applicants.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "x2IjROxHuYY",
        "ts": "0:30:36",
        "endTs": "0:32:06",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:00.900Z"
      },
      "body": "Independent Nomination Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-09",
      "text": "Voters will decide in November on a charter change that would dissolve the board.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "x2IjROxHuYY",
        "ts": "0:17:27",
        "endTs": "0:17:57",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:00.900Z"
      },
      "body": "Independent Nomination Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-13",
      "text": "The chair reported that voters will decide whether to abolish a board involved in commission appointments.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "mEoIJx_G1XQ",
        "ts": "0:40:08",
        "endTs": "0:40:38",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-12T06:30:06.096Z"
      },
      "body": "Cost of Government Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-13",
      "text": "The amendment would still need voter approval at the November general election.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "DN-bXIWkS7E",
        "ts": "0:28:52",
        "endTs": "0:29:22",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:15.675Z"
      },
      "body": "Independent Nomination Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-13",
      "text": "Members said sending someone to the second reading was not worth their time.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "DN-bXIWkS7E",
        "ts": "0:27:06",
        "endTs": "0:27:59",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:15.675Z"
      },
      "body": "Independent Nomination Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-13",
      "text": "It needs two readings with at least six council votes to reach the ballot.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "DN-bXIWkS7E",
        "ts": "0:26:43",
        "endTs": "0:27:13",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:15.675Z"
      },
      "body": "Independent Nomination Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-13",
      "text": "Staff reported the County Council passed, on first reading, a charter amendment to dissolve the Independent Nomination Board.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "DN-bXIWkS7E",
        "ts": "0:25:37",
        "endTs": "0:26:22",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:15.675Z"
      },
      "body": "Independent Nomination Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-13",
      "text": "Staff will bring the mass nomination flyer to the next meeting as a format for outreach to community associations.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "DN-bXIWkS7E",
        "ts": "0:07:01",
        "endTs": "0:07:31",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:15.675Z"
      },
      "body": "Independent Nomination Board"
    },
    {
